# ============================================================
# Proto-Gen — Root Environment Example
# ============================================================
# The actual secrets go in: /server/.env
# See server/.env.example for the full configuration template.
#
# HOW TO SETUP:
#   1. cd server
#   2. cp .env.example .env
#   3. Fill in your API keys in server/.env
#   4. NEVER commit .env files — they are git-ignored
# ============================================================
